5051	ir.model.fields,help	840	ca_ES	model	The Separator Format should be like [,n] where 0 < n :starting from Unit digit. -1 will end the separation. e.g. [3,2,-1] will represent 106500 to be 1,06,500; [1,2,-1] will represent it to be 106,50,0;[3] will represent it as 106,500. Provided ',' as the thousand separator in each case.	﻿El format de separació hauria de ser com [,n] on 0 < n, començant pel dígit unitat. -1 acabarà la separació. Per ex. [3,2,-1] representarà 106500 com 1,06,500; [1,2,-1] ho representarà com 106,50,0; [3] ho representarà com 106,500. Sempre que ',' sigui el separador de mil en cada cas.	base	translated	
