5354	ir.module.module,description	16	ca_ES	model	\nAdd additional date information to the sales order.\n===================================================\n\nYou can add the following additional dates to a sales order:\n------------------------------------------------------------\n    * Requested Date (will be used as the expected date on pickings)\n    * Commitment Date\n    * Effective Date\n	\nAfegeix informació de dates per les comandes de venda.\n===================================================\n\nPot afegir les següents dates a les comandes de venda:\n------------------------------------------------------------\n* Data de sol·licitud (s'utilitzarà com la data prevista en albarans)\n* Data de recollida\n* Data efectiva\n	base	translated	
