22185	product.product,website_description	20	ca_ES	model	How did we make an already gorgeous widescreen display even better? By making it 75 percent less reflective. And by re-architecting the LCD and moving it right up against the cover glass. So you see your photos, games, movies, and everything else in vivid, lifelike detail.	Com hem fet una preciosa pantalla ampla encara millor? Agafant-la i fent-la un 75% menys reflectiva. I reestructurant el LCD i movent-lo amunt contra la coberta de vidre. Així podràs veure les teves fotos, jocs, pel·lícules, i tota la resta amb uns detalls vius i reals.	product	translated	
22186	product.template,website_description	17	ca_ES	model	How did we make an already gorgeous widescreen display even better? By making it 75 percent less reflective. And by re-architecting the LCD and moving it right up against the cover glass. So you see your photos, games, movies, and everything else in vivid, lifelike detail.	Com hem fet una preciosa pantalla ampla encara millor? Agafant-la i fent-la un 75% menys reflectiva. I reestructurant el LCD i movent-lo amunt contra la coberta de vidre. Així podràs veure les teves fotos, jocs, pel·lícules, i tota la resta amb uns detalls vius i reals.	product	translated	
