2	Plan to install backup servers	2020-03-18 13:32:00	<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>We need to deploy new backup servers, with the following requirements:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>daily incremental backups, with an history of 15 days,</li>\n    <li>45 servers should be backuped between 1am and 3am when our offices are closed,</li>\n    <li>two redundant servers,</li>\n    <li>total capacity of 200Gb.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n    Do you have a simple solution with servers running on Redhat Linux?\n</p>\n<p>Best regards,</p>\n<pre><span data-o-mail-quote="1">--\nVirginie Agrolait\nvirginie@agrolait.fr</span></pre>	\N	\N	\N	\N	email	1	\N	virginie@agrolait.fr	\N	f	<380632791281132.1584711142.718345880508423-openerp-private@elpuig>	virginie@agrolait.fr	\N	1	2020-03-20 13:32:20.4714	1	2020-03-20 13:32:20.4714
